5. Tournament Site theme adaptations (permission for this project)
-----------------------------------------------------------------

Source: https://rating.chgk.info/build/app.d238e743.css
Repository snapshot: themes.css; bundled derivative: popup-themes.css.

On 2026-10-04, the TS_switcher maintainer confirmed that the Tournament Site
administrators permitted use of these themes in TS_switcher. This is the
date of the maintainer's confirmation, not a claimed date of the original
permission. No explicit public license for the site's own theme blocks was
identified. This notice records that permission; it does not grant an MIT
license to the site's materials or represent that the administrators granted
unrestricted sublicensing rights. Third-party palette notices above continue
to apply to their respective materials.

6. Extension icons (Emoji Kitchen source artwork)
------------------------------------------------

Files: icons/*.png (src/icons/ in the repository).

The extension icons were prepared by Anton Berezanskiy using
https://emojikitchen.dev/, as confirmed by the maintainer on 2026-10-04.
That website provides access to Google's Emoji Kitchen illustrations:
https://github.com/xsalazar/emoji-kitchen

The MIT grant covers only the maintainer's original contributions to these
icons, to the extent licensable by the maintainer. It does not relicense the
underlying third-party artwork. An explicit license permitting redistribution
and relicensing of that artwork was not identified during this review.
Attribution is not a substitute for such permission. The license of the
separate Google Noto Emoji project is not assumed to cover Emoji Kitchen
illustrations. The same limitation applies where this artwork is reproduced
in documentation screenshots.

